dex2jvm was developed as part of Mac.apk, which runs Android apps on macOS.

Portions of the design are derived from enjarify
(https://github.com/google/enjarify), Copyright 2015 Google Inc.,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. In particular the
register type-inference model, the one-Dalvik-register-to-many-JVM-locals
mapping, the split constant pool and the output jar layout follow
enjarify's approach. dex2jvm is an independent Java implementation; no
enjarify source files are included.
